                                                                                                     "heading":  "Product Specifications",
                                                                                                     "content":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Recliner Sofa Bed \u003c/strong\u003e: Designed to serve as both a comfortable lounge chair and a spacious floor bed, with simple transformation for relaxation, reading, or overnight guests.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-Positioning Recliner \u003c/strong\u003e: The backrest adjusts to six different angles, giving personalized ergonomic support and plush cushioning make this floor lounger ideal for both sitting upright or reclining comfortably, so you can sit straight or lean back and relax with ease.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSuperior Comfort:\u003c/strong\u003e Thick cushioning made of high-resilience foam and over 99% pure doll cotton provides plush, continuous support. Built with a Sturdy thick steel internal frame and reliable adjustment brackets for lasting durability and stable support.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCorduroy Upholstery:\u003c/strong\u003e Premium corduroy fabric cover delivers a soft, cozy feel and a modern minimalist look, blending easily with any living space. precision-crafted reclining mechanism that provides stability and durability, the material feels nice on the skin and is easy to clean for daily use.\u003c/p\u003e"
                                                                                                 }
                                                                                },
                                                     "collapsible-row-1":  {
                                                                               "type":  "feature",
                                                                               "settings":  {
                                                                                                "heading":  "Product features",
                                                                                                "content":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpacious Size: \u003c/strong\u003eExpanded length up to 178 cm and width of 95 cm easily accommodates adults and teens, offering generous space for lounging and sleeping\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser-Friendly Design:\u003c/strong\u003e Features a removable pillow for extra neck and back comfort, a removable cover with a zipper for easy cleaning, and a lightweight frame for simple repositioning.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFamily-Friendly:\u003c/strong\u003e Safe, low-profile design and rounded corners ensure suitability for homes with children or elderly family members\u003c/p\u003e",
