                                                                                                      "heading":  "Materials and care",
                                                                                                      "content":  "\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMain Material:\u003c/strong\u003e High elasticity doll cotton filling, high-resilience sponge cushioning, soft corduroy fabric upholstery, and thick steel adjustment frame for a robust yet plush feel.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRemovable Fabric Cover:\u003c/strong\u003e Equipped with an easy-to-use zipper—simply unzip and remove the outer cover for machine washing or spot-cleaning as needed.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCare Instructions:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eDust regularly with a soft brush or vacuum upholstery attachment to keep fabric lint-free and looking fresh.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eWipe spills promptly with a dry or slightly damp cloth.For a deeper clean, machine wash the removable cover on a gentle cycle with a mild detergent and air dry flat.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAvoid direct sunlight or excessive moisture exposure to maintain color and durability.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDo Not:\u003c/strong\u003e Bleach, iron, or tumble dry the cover. Avoid placing sharp objects or heavy items on the sofa bed to prevent fabric tearing or deformation\u003c/p\u003e",
                                                                                                      "page":  "materials-and-care"
